-- WeddingLens vendor data - Sri Lankan wedding vendors
-- ==========================================================================
-- SOURCING & HONESTY NOTES (read before treating this as ground truth):
-- - Business names and locations were sourced via web search in August
--   2026 from public Sri Lankan business directories (primarily
--   rainbowpages.lk, Sri Lanka Telecom's official directory, and a
--   'Top 15 Florists' roundup on reviewguru.lk), plus currently-active
--   vendors' own websites/Instagram/Facebook pages and wedding-industry
--   roundup articles (yourhappymoments.net, mywed.com, wedmegood.com).
-- - `wedding_style` is THIS PROJECT'S OWN editorial categorization for
--   demo/recommendation-matching purposes - it is not a claim made by
--   the business itself about which of the app's 6 style classes it
--   belongs to. Retagged back to the original 6-class taxonomy (boho_chic,
--   rustic_barn, luxury_glamour, garden_floral, minimalist_modern,
--   traditional_classic) at the project owner's request, to stay aligned
--   with the formal project proposal - reverting a since-abandoned 5-class
--   Sri Lankan-market taxonomy experiment (see CLAUDE.md and
--   ml-service/archive_5class_taxonomy/). Cycling through the 6 styles per
--   category in vendor-id order (15 vendors / 6 styles doesn't divide
--   evenly - 3 styles land 3 vendors/category, 3 styles land 2/category,
--   deterministically by id order).
-- - `rating` is NULL unless a specific figure was itself reported in a
--   source (never fabricated for a real business).
-- - `contact_info` holds a real phone/email/website ONLY where one was
--   found in a source; otherwise it is NULL, rather than inventing one.
-- - `image_url`: for 11 of 12 categories, this is a REAL reference photo
--   the project owner personally supplied (see ml-service/notebooks/<Category>/
--   for the originals), copied into backend/vendor-images/<category>/ and
--   assigned so every vendor in a category has its own distinct photo (no
--   two vendors share one) - see CLAUDE.md's extension #7 notes. `venue`
--   is the one category still on a real, properly-licensed Unsplash photo
--   (no local venue photos were supplied) - `image_photographer`/
--   `image_photographer_url` are only set for these Unsplash-sourced rows,
--   for correct per-photo attribution; local-photo rows leave both NULL
--   since no Unsplash attribution applies to them.
-- - `instagram_url`/`facebook_url`/`tiktok_url`/`website_url` are real,
--   found-via-search links, present ONLY where an actual account/page/site
--   was located for that exact business (most vendors have none on record
--   here - that's accurate, not a gap to fill with a guess).
-- - Contact details, addresses, and trading status can change and were
--   not independently re-verified beyond the cited search results -
--   confirm directly with the vendor before relying on this for real
--   wedding planning.
-- ==========================================================================

TRUNCATE TABLE vendors RESTART IDENTITY;

